WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,390 --> 00:00:02,670
Where is this shelter?

2
00:00:02,910 --> 00:00:06,220
It’s all canned meat

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:18,300
It's probably a wave of internal losses. What should I do, boss? I'm going down now.

4
00:00:18,620 --> 00:00:19,700
Just give them food rations

5
00:00:20,260 --> 00:00:28,080
Wait for the tide to recede and it won’t stop here.

6
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:29,880
The wave of loss is in full swing

7
00:00:40,820 --> 00:01:01,500
It was safe here last night. Here, here, here, here, here, here, here, here, here, here, here, here, here, here, here.

8
00:01:02,260 --> 00:01:04,380
Is it not safe to go anywhere in the future?

9
00:01:04,780 --> 00:01:10,100
When will I be able to benefit?

10
00:01:10,500 --> 00:01:13,140
I want to help too, don't worry

11
00:01:13,500 --> 00:01:15,100
Maybe it will be fine when you wake up after a nap.
